<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第四步 · 对照：落在垄断与竞争之间</p></content></shape><table topLeftX="48" topLeftY="96" width="864" height="230"><colgroup><col width="230"/><col width="150"/><col width="180"/><col width="140"/><col width="164"/></colgroup><tr height="50"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>市场结构</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>每家产量</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>行业总产量</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>价格</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>行业总利润</p></content></td></tr><tr height="60"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>垄断（1 家）</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{2b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{2b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a+c}{2}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{(a-c)^2}{4b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td></tr><tr height="60"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>古诺双寡头（2 家）</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{3b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{2(a-c)}{3b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a+2c}{3}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(210,90,86,0.14)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{2(a-c)^2}{9b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td></tr><tr height="60"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>完全竞争（无穷多家）</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>趋于 0</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[\frac{a-c}{b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[c]]></latex></formula></p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>0</p></content></td></tr></table><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="340" width="864" height="70"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>只多出一个竞争者，行业总产量就增加三分之一，价格与行业利润随之下降；但离完全竞争还差三分之一。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="418" width="864" height="50"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>知识创造的要点：新结论只有放进已知结论的坐标系里，才显出它的位置和价值。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [4] --></p><p>把垄断、古诺和完全竞争三行并排：古诺的总产量是 2/3，正好在垄断的 1/2 和完全竞争的 1 之间。</p><p>价格也一样：垄断加成是一半，古诺是三分之一，完全竞争为零。</p><p>这一步是知识创造里最容易被忽略的一步——对照。没有对照，一个数字只是数字；有了对照，它才是一个有位置的结论。</p></content></note></slide>